   "cooked": "<p>I’ve been playing with the bonding curve of the proposals for the Commons upgrade run-off vote, and want to share some tests that are designed to enrich the Voters pamphlet that will be shared soon:</p>\n<p><strong>I tried this conditions for every proposal</strong><br/>\n*(10 million WxDAI buy + 1 million TEC sell)<br/>\n*(How many WxDAI buy to mint approx. 2 million token - matching hatchers initial distribution)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>For 4.20 public open</strong>, see this issue: <a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/commons-config-proposals/issues/144\">4.20 Public Open Meets Ostrom’s $1M Hatch, Fledge &amp; Fly! (simulation 10 million WxDAI in, 1 million TEC out) · Issue #144 · CommonsBuild/commons-config-proposals · GitHub</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/74bf77b84dab937327a6c5c606f16b6bf9f3d11c\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/74bf77b84dab937327a6c5c606f16b6bf9f3d11c.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"gENBshQyJM6HnAGkY6RcTE60I1e\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/74bf77b84dab937327a6c5c606f16b6bf9f3d11c_2_10x10.png\" height=\"68\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/74bf77b84dab937327a6c5c606f16b6bf9f3d11c_2_624x68.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/74bf77b84dab937327a6c5c606f16b6bf9f3d11c_2_624x68.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/74bf77b84dab937327a6c5c606f16b6bf9f3d11c_2_936x102.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/74bf77b84dab937327a6c5c606f16b6bf9f3d11c_2_1248x136.png 2x\" width=\"624\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×174 45.5 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p>In this proposal, entering 10 million WxDAI into the bonding curve, 422676 new TEC will be minted (that is almost 1/5 of total hatcher’s tokens - Meaning that in this scenario, newcomers will have approximately 21% of the hatcher’s governance). With these conditions, the price of the token will rise 77%, making it 53.94 WxDAI per TEC. This can make it attractive to hatchers to sell (assuming the vesting period is over), and if 50% of the hatchers sell their tokens (1 million TEC) the price of the token will drop to 0.06 WxDAI. (Lower than the initial price of hatchers and the bonding curve)</p>\n<p>To mint an approximation of hatcher’s TEC Tokens, <strong>10.000.000.000 WxDAI will be needed</strong>.<br/>\n</p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/86ef961f34dbdcf9e72e28ad7cb8bbffba60a7f0\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/86ef961f34dbdcf9e72e28ad7cb8bbffba60a7f0.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"jfHi8CdrMVD9wVUkgEnskPxQEtW\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/86ef961f34dbdcf9e72e28ad7cb8bbffba60a7f0_2_10x10.png\" height=\"43\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/86ef961f34dbdcf9e72e28ad7cb8bbffba60a7f0_2_624x43.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/86ef961f34dbdcf9e72e28ad7cb8bbffba60a7f0_2_624x43.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/86ef961f34dbdcf9e72e28ad7cb8bbffba60a7f0_2_936x64.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/86ef961f34dbdcf9e72e28ad7cb8bbffba60a7f0_2_1248x86.png 2x\" width=\"624\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×108 28.3 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>For <strong>Mathmematics V4</strong> , see this issue: <a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/commons-config-proposals/issues/143\">Mathmematics V4 back to the (square) roots, but still with 1 MEMILLION COMMON POOL (simulation 10 million WxDAI in, 1 million TEC out) · Issue #143 · CommonsBuild/commons-config-proposals · GitHub</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/94e34d360061de7776688e25857e561f527aa552\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/94e34d360061de7776688e25857e561f527aa552.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"lf7EJM6Zb7QjFSgmXpXvT7YfJce\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/94e34d360061de7776688e25857e561f527aa552_2_10x10.png\" height=\"68\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/94e34d360061de7776688e25857e561f527aa552_2_624x68.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/94e34d360061de7776688e25857e561f527aa552_2_624x68.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/94e34d360061de7776688e25857e561f527aa552_2_936x102.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/94e34d360061de7776688e25857e561f527aa552_2_1248x136.png 2x\" width=\"624\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×174 48.1 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p>In this proposal, entering 10 million WxDAI into the bonding curve, 1225393 new TEC will be minted (that is almost 6/10 of total hatcher’s tokens - Meaning that in this scenario, newcomers will have approximately 61% of the hatcher’s governance). With these conditions, the price of the token will rise 79%, making it 19.83 WxDAI per TEC. This can make it attractive to hatchers to sell (assuming the vesting period is over), and if 50% of the hatchers sell their tokens (1 million TEC) the price of the token will drop to 2.81 WxDAI. (Higher than the initial price of both Hatchers and the Bonding curve)</p>\n<p>To mint an approximation of hatcher’s TEC Tokens, <strong>40.000.000 WxDAI will be needed</strong>.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/661e1a8ae5c69fd6dff1fb86d7b9318d766a6bf4\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/661e1a8ae5c69fd6dff1fb86d7b9318d766a6bf4.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"ezncki08DTSHvmfsvNAIGed7ERC\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/661e1a8ae5c69fd6dff1fb86d7b9318d766a6bf4_2_10x10.png\" height=\"41\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/661e1a8ae5c69fd6dff1fb86d7b9318d766a6bf4_2_624x41.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/661e1a8ae5c69fd6dff1fb86d7b9318d766a6bf4_2_624x41.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/661e1a8ae5c69fd6dff1fb86d7b9318d766a6bf4_2_936x61.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/661e1a8ae5c69fd6dff1fb86d7b9318d766a6bf4_2_1248x82.png 2x\" width=\"624\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×105 25.7 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>For <strong>Bolcheviks Gambit</strong>, see this issue:<br/>\n<a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/commons-config-proposals/issues/142\">The Bolshevik's Gambit fork with Revolutionary Opening Price and Iron Curtain Conviction Voting (simulation 10 million WxDAI in, 1 million TEC out) · Issue #142 · CommonsBuild/commons-config-proposals · GitHub</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/acdfa7cc7fb746f343e2fb8f2e8e0fabd6c30101\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/acdfa7cc7fb746f343e2fb8f2e8e0fabd6c30101.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"oFjiSEe614NFuRD6jZe3ohuHsjf\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/acdfa7cc7fb746f343e2fb8f2e8e0fabd6c30101_2_10x10.png\" height=\"63\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/acdfa7cc7fb746f343e2fb8f2e8e0fabd6c30101_2_624x63.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/acdfa7cc7fb746f343e2fb8f2e8e0fabd6c30101_2_624x63.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/acdfa7cc7fb746f343e2fb8f2e8e0fabd6c30101_2_936x94.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/acdfa7cc7fb746f343e2fb8f2e8e0fabd6c30101_2_1248x126.png 2x\" width=\"624\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×162 43.1 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p>In this proposal, entering 10 million WxDAI into the bonding curve, 1474667 new TEC will be minted (that is almost 3/4 of total hatcher’s tokens - Meaning that in this scenario, newcomers will have approximately 73% of the hatcher’s governance). With these conditions, the price of the token will rise 73%, making it 13.92 WxDAI per TEC. This can make it attractive to hatchers to sell (assuming the vesting period is over), and if 50% of the hatchers sell their tokens (1 million TEC) the price of the token will drop to 3.71 WxDAI. (Higher than the initial price of both Hatchers and the Bonding curve)</p>\n<p>To mint an approximation of hatcher’s TEC Tokens, <strong>20.000.000 WxDAI will be needed</strong>.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/dbc2757c6ab80116a4e7a9760ab3c50c846ce4a3\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/dbc2757c6ab80116a4e7a9760ab3c50c846ce4a3.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"vm5bVrFE8sgFBwm8gVr38aBaHrJ\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/dbc2757c6ab80116a4e7a9760ab3c50c846ce4a3_2_10x10.png\" height=\"36\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/dbc2757c6ab80116a4e7a9760ab3c50c846ce4a3_2_624x36.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/dbc2757c6ab80116a4e7a9760ab3c50c846ce4a3_2_624x36.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/dbc2757c6ab80116a4e7a9760ab3c50c846ce4a3_2_936x54.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/dbc2757c6ab80116a4e7a9760ab3c50c846ce4a3_2_1248x72.png 2x\" width=\"624\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×92 28.2 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>For <strong>Goldilocks $1 bet for 1 mill</strong>, see this issue<br/>\n<a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/commons-config-proposals/issues/141\">Goldilocks' $1 bet for $1 mil to Advance Token Engineering (simulation 10 million WxDAI in, 1 million TEC out) · Issue #141 · CommonsBuild/commons-config-proposals · GitHub</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/dd79aab6c279cc9fe82dc676736520d3960a98e3\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/dd79aab6c279cc9fe82dc676736520d3960a98e3.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"vBgbQbCWwbsJ10uIEvNWyyJdzvJ\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/dd79aab6c279cc9fe82dc676736520d3960a98e3_2_10x10.png\" height=\"67\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/dd79aab6c279cc9fe82dc676736520d3960a98e3_2_624x67.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/dd79aab6c279cc9fe82dc676736520d3960a98e3_2_624x67.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/dd79aab6c279cc9fe82dc676736520d3960a98e3_2_936x100.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/dd79aab6c279cc9fe82dc676736520d3960a98e3_2_1248x134.png 2x\" width=\"624\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×172 45.8 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p>In this proposal, entering 10 million WxDAI into the bonding curve, 1442473 new TEC will be minted (that is almost 3/4 of total hatcher’s tokens - Meaning that in this scenario, newcomers will have approximately 72% of the hatcher’s governance). With these conditions, the price of the token will rise 71%, making it 11.71 WxDAI per TEC. This can make it attractive to hatchers to sell (assuming the vesting period is over), and if 50% of the hatchers sell their tokens (1 million TEC) the price of the token will drop to 3.20 WxDAI. (Higher than the initial price of both Hatchers and the Bonding curve)</p>\n<p>To mint an approximation of hatcher’s TEC Tokens, <strong>20.000.000 WxDAI will be needed</strong>.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/f1952931627ea7bfe961a435659f6e32e14a35eb\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/f1952931627ea7bfe961a435659f6e32e14a35eb.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"yt8E3OuKLOZLQB5ySSlZox28ERR\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f1952931627ea7bfe961a435659f6e32e14a35eb_2_10x10.png\" height=\"36\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f1952931627ea7bfe961a435659f6e32e14a35eb_2_624x36.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f1952931627ea7bfe961a435659f6e32e14a35eb_2_624x36.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f1952931627ea7bfe961a435659f6e32e14a35eb_2_936x54.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f1952931627ea7bfe961a435659f6e32e14a35eb_2_1248x72.png 2x\" width=\"624\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×91 26.1 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>For <strong>Ostrom’s 1 million baby</strong>, see this issue<br/>\n<a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/commons-config-proposals/issues/140\">Ostrom's 1 million dollar baby (simulation 10 million WxDAI in, 1 million TEC out) · Issue #140 · CommonsBuild/commons-config-proposals · GitHub</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/5e9a769fa87f8a3222097fd5a0814b94f59327b6\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/5e9a769fa87f8a3222097fd5a0814b94f59327b6.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"duTOKdi2re1quVwrzxnAOZrWmvs\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/5e9a769fa87f8a3222097fd5a0814b94f59327b6_2_10x10.png\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/5e9a769fa87f8a3222097fd5a0814b94f59327b6_2_624x56.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/5e9a769fa87f8a3222097fd5a0814b94f59327b6_2_624x56.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/5e9a769fa87f8a3222097fd5a0814b94f59327b6_2_936x84.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/5e9a769fa87f8a3222097fd5a0814b94f59327b6_2_1248x112.png 2x\" width=\"624\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">1600×145 46.5 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p>In this proposal, entering 10 million WxDAI into the bonding curve, 2036806 new TEC will be minted (that is almost the same of total hatcher’s tokens - Meaning that in this scenario, newcomers will have approximately the same amount of the hatcher’s governance). With these conditions, the price of the token will rise 74%, making it 9.97 WxDAI per TEC. This can make it attractive to hatchers to sell (assuming the vesting period is over), and if 50% of the hatchers sell their tokens (1 million TEC) the price of the token will drop to 4.07 WxDAI. (Higher than the initial price of both Hatchers and the Bonding curve).</p>\n<p>To mint an approximation of hatcher’s TEC Tokens, <strong>10.000.000 WxDAI</strong> will be needed.</p>",
