   "cooked": "<p>These are another tests i’ve been running, with 50 million WxDAI entering the bonding curve, and 50% of hatchers tokens being sold.</p><aside class=\"onebox googledocs\" data-onebox-src=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jsaP8O08AmJAOmY6oINP6rhutSv-LknG_rbbavEuZVo/edit#gid=0\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jsaP8O08AmJAOmY6oINP6rhutSv-LknG_rbbavEuZVo/edit#gid=0\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">docs.google.com</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jsaP8O08AmJAOmY6oINP6rhutSv-LknG_rbbavEuZVo/edit#gid=0\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"googledocs-onebox-logo g-sheets-logo\"></span></a>\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jsaP8O08AmJAOmY6oINP6rhutSv-LknG_rbbavEuZVo/edit#gid=0\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Proposals bonding curve test with 50 Million in</a></h3>\n<p>Hoja 1\n\nGovernance tests with 50 million WxDAI entering the Bonding Curve\n4.20.\nHatchers tokens,TEC minted with 50 million entering the Bonding curve\n2000000,710761\nIf 50% of hatchers tokens are sold (1000000) with 50 million WxDAI in the bonding...</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>",
